# Copy to `.env` for local dev, and set the same two in the Vercel project.
#
# The ANON key only. This is a static bundle — anything here is readable by
# anyone who opens devtools, which is fine for the anon key (it is designed to
# be public and is already shipped in the mobile app) and catastrophic for the
# service_role key. Never put a service_role key in this project.
#
# What an admin can actually see is decided by RLS + the admin_users allowlist
# in the database, not by this file.
